<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Earrings</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Malcolm Todd</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Sweet Boy</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0eAuGrXyGFYwur9ARUe7LJ</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.749" end="00:03.193">Her love is in your head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.193" end="00:06.326">You lost your earrings in her bed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.326" end="00:09.535">You couldn't tell her that you lost 'em</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.535" end="00:12.410">'Cause you're scared and you're not talking</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.410" end="00:15.145">So you think of what to say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.145" end="00:18.207">Then save it for another day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.207" end="00:21.218">'Cause you just never had the heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.218" end="00:24.440">Now they just drift further apart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.440" end="00:30.351">From you, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.351" end="00:36.344">From you, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.344" end="00:42.180">From you, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.180" end="00:50.180">From you, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.852" end="01:15.054">Her love is in your head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.054" end="01:18.178">You lost your earrings in her bed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.178" end="01:21.415">You couldn't tell her that you lost 'em</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.415" end="01:24.398">'Cause you're scared and you're not talking</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.398" end="01:27.096">So you think of what to say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.096" end="01:30.090">Then save it for another day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.090" end="01:33.157">'Cause you just never had the heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.157" end="01:36.452">Now they just drift further apart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.452" end="01:37.952">From you, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.400" end="01:40.268">Extra, еxtra, read all about it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.268" end="01:43.281">Mac is in his feelings and he can't get out of it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.281" end="01:46.223">Extra, extra, read all about it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.223" end="01:49.233">Mac is in his feelings and he can't get out of it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.233" end="01:52.245">Extra, extra, read all about it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.245" end="01:55.209">Mac is in his feelings and he can't get out of it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.209" end="01:58.250">Extra, extra, read all about it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.250" end="02:01.122">Mac is in his feelings and he can't get out of it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.122" end="02:06.024">From you, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.024" end="02:12.115">From you, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.115" end="02:13.615">From you, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.261" end="02:16.362">Extra, extra, read all about it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.362" end="02:19.121">Mac is in his feelings and he can't get out of it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.121" end="02:22.182">Extra, extra, read all about it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.182" end="02:25.198">Mac is in his feelings and he can't get out of it</p><